+dotnet_diagnostic.BRO1111.severity = none
+# init: 'new T { ... }' with an initializer: your code mixes both forms (46 without '()', 35 with '()'), so BRO1141 is off. To choose one: set stylebro_object_creation_parentheses and remove the next line.
